---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About Verto"><PageHero eyebrow="ABOUT VERTO" title="Behind every application, a person." text="A new job, time with family, a different horizon. We start by understanding what your next chapter means to you."/><section class="section container split-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">PERSONAL ATTENTION. PRACTICAL GUIDANCE.</span><h2>Your circumstances shape the conversation.</h2><p>Verto Immigration Inc. provides work permit and visa application support. Our starting point is your story: where you are now, your reason for coming to Canada, and the questions you need answered before you take the next step.</p><p>Our approach is built around a simple sequence. Understand the request. Discuss the scope. Explain the fees. Agree on a plan. Good guidance should help you understand the choices in front of you.</p><div class="values" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px"><div><span>OUR APPROACH</span><h3>Listen first. Explain clearly. Proceed thoughtfully.</h3><p>We make space for questions and encourage you to verify your representative and understand your service agreement.</p></div></div><h3>A private service, independent of government</h3><p>Verto does not make immigration decisions and is not affiliated with the Government of Canada. Professional support does not guarantee approval, a job or a processing date.</p></div><aside class="info-panel"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR IMMIGRATION CONTACT</span><h3>{site.consultant}</h3><p>College ID: {site.collegeId}</p><p>Check the College’s public register for current eligibility, licence details and contact information. Confirm you are speaking with the person listed before sharing documents or paying.</p><a class="underlink" href={site.register} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the public register ↗</a><p style="margin-top:30px"><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br/><a href={`tel:${site.tel}`}>{site.phone}</a></p></aside></section><CTA/></Layout>
